*** Keywords ***
the page is showing Sign Up form
    User membuka aplikasi GherkinPilot Native
    Wait Until Element Is Visible    //android.widget.TextView[@text="Formulir\nPendaftaran"]
    Sleep    1s

I fill in Nama Lengkap "${nama_lengkap}"
    Click Element    //android.widget.EditText[@resource-id="textfield_page_pendaftaran_fullname"]
    Input Text    //android.widget.EditText[@resource-id="textfield_page_pendaftaran_fullname"]    ${nama_lengkap}
    Sleep    1s

I fill in Registered Email "${email}"
    Click Element    //android.widget.EditText[@resource-id="textfield_page_pendaftaran_email"]
    Input Text    //android.widget.EditText[@resource-id="textfield_page_pendaftaran_email"]    ${email}
    Hide Keyboard
    Sleep    1s
    

 I choose Tipe Akun "${tipe_akun}"
    Click Element    ${tipe_akun}
    Sleep    2s

I click agree of term of condition
    Click Element    //android.widget.CheckBox[@content-desc="checkbox_page_pendaftaran_term_condition"]
    Sleep    1s

I should see activated button "Lanjutkan"
    Element Should Be Visible   //android.view.View[@resource-id="button_page_pendaftaran_lanjutkan"]
    Sleep    1s

I click button "Lanjutkan"
    Click Element    //android.view.View[@resource-id="button_page_pendaftaran_lanjutkan"]
    Sleep    3s   

I should see error message notification "${err_msg}"
    Run Keyword If    '${err_msg}' == 'Email Sudah Terdaftar'     Wait Until Page Contains Element    //android.widget.Toast[@text="Email sudah terdaftar"]    5s 
    ...     ELSE IF   '${err_msg}' == 'Email Tidak Valid'    Wait Until Page Contains Element    //android.widget.TextView[@text="Email tidak valid."]    5s 
    ...     ELSE    Log To Console    Validasi Belum Lengkap
    Capture Page Screenshot